      "content": "<!-- ===================================================================== -->\n<!-- DÉBUT DE LA SECTION \"COMMUNIQUÉ 1ER MAI & CARTE\" (VERSION HOSTINGER) -->\n<!-- ===================================================================== -->\n<!-- 1. MOTEUR GRAPHIQUE -->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\"/>\n<link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\"/>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&amp;family=Lato:wght@300;400;600&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n        theme: {\n            extend: {\n                colors: {\n                    'village-dark': '#713506',\n                    'village-light': '#f5f0ea',\n                    'village-white': '#ffffff',\n                    'village-bg': '#fcf9f3',\n                    'village-accent': '#9d623d',\n                },\n                fontFamily: {\n                    'serif': ['\"Playfair Display\"', 'serif'],\n                    'cursive': ['\"Great Vibes\"', 'cursive'],\n                    'sans': ['\"Lato\"', 'sans-serif'],\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n</script>\n<style>\n    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #fcf9f3; }\n\n    /* --- LETTRINE (Drop Cap) --- */\n    .drop-cap::first-letter {\n        font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;\n        font-size: 5.5rem;\n        float: left;\n        line-height: 0.85;\n        margin-right: 0.5rem;\n        color: #9d623d;\n    }\n\n    /* --- IMAGE ENCADRÉE TYPE MENU (Cliquable) --- */\n    .menu-presentation-frame {\n        background: #ffffff;\n        padding: 12px;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(113, 53, 6, 0.15);\n        box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(113, 53, 6, 0.12);\n        transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\n        border-radius: 2px;\n        width: 100%;\n        position: relative;\n        display: block;\n        text-decoration: none;\n    }\n    .menu-presentation-frame:hover {\n        transform: translateY(-5px);\n        box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(113, 53, 6, 0.20);\n    }\n    .menu-image-inner {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(157, 98, 61, 0.3);\n    }\n    .menu-image-inner img {\n        width: 100%;\n        display: block;\n        transition: transform 0.8s ease;\n    }\n    .menu-presentation-frame:hover .menu-image-inner img {\n        transform: scale(1.03);\n    }\n</style>\n<!-- 2. CONTENU VISUEL -->\n<div class=\"font-serif antialiased w-full bg-village-bg overflow-hidden\" id=\"village-communique-1ermai-block\">\n<!-- SECTION HERO DE L'ARTICLE -->\n<section class=\"relative w-full h-[400px] md:h-[500px] lg:h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n<!-- Image événementielle festive et printanière -->\n<img alt=\"Ambiance festive et printanière au Village\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"/assets/images/enhanced/cocktail-terrasse.webp\" style=\"object-position: center 40%;\"/>\n<!-- Voile assombrissant pour lire le texte -->\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-village-bg via-village-dark/50 to-village-dark/70\"></div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 text-center px-6 mt-16 md:mt-0 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n<span class=\"font-sans text-village-light uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs md:text-sm block mb-4\">Communiqué de Presse</span>\n<h1 class=\"font-cursive text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl text-village-white drop-shadow-lg mb-6 leading-tight\">\n                Week-end du 1er Mai : <br/>Fête des Mai &amp; DJ Set \n            </h1>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- CORPS DU COMMUNIQUÉ -->\n<article class=\"w-full pb-24 -mt-10 md:-mt-16 relative z-20\">\n<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6\">\n<div class=\"bg-village-white shadow-xl p-8 md:p-16 lg:p-20 relative\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start\">\n<!-- Colonne Texte (Storytelling de la carte) -->\n<div class=\"w-full lg:w-3/5\">\n<p class=\"font-sans text-sm text-village-accent uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 border-b border-village-accent/20 pb-4\">Cagnes-sur-Mer — Printemps 2026</p>\n<p class=\"drop-cap text-lg md:text-xl text-village-dark/90 leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                            Le vendredi 1er mai ouvre la voie aux beaux jours et aux week-ends prolongés. Pour célébrer ce renouveau, Le Grimaldi by Le Village vous invite à vivre trois jours d'exception sur la Place du Château.\n                        </p>\n<!-- Vendredi 1er Mai -->\n<h4 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-village-dark mt-10 mb-4\">Vendredi 1er Mai : La Fête des Mai</h4>\n<p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-village-dark/80 leading-relaxed font-sans mb-8\">\n                            Dès le matin, le Haut-de-Cagnes s'anime au rythme de la traditionnelle <strong>Fête des Mai</strong>. L'ambiance provençale reprend ses droits avec la farandole sous les « Mai » et les animations locales. Prenez place sur notre terrasse face au château pour profiter de l'effervescence en toute sérénité.\n                        </p>\n<!-- La Nouvelle Carte -->\n<h4 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-village-dark mt-12 mb-4\">La Nouvelle Carte : Fraîcheur méditerranéenne</h4>\n<p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-village-dark/80 leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6\">\n                            Adieu l'hiver. Le Chef Patrice Rémy dévoile une nouvelle carte éclatante, pensée comme un hommage aux produits gorgés de soleil de notre terroir. L'occasion idéale pour la découvrir lors de ce grand week-end.\n                        </p>\n<p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-village-dark/80 leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6\">\n                            Pour commencer, la fraîcheur s'impose avec le <strong>Tartare de Saumon frais</strong> (lime, avocat brûlé et sésame), les emblématiques <strong>Panisses artisanaux de la Maison Daqi</strong> ou encore la véritable <strong>Burrata crémeuse d'Italie</strong>.\n                        </p>\n<p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-village-dark/80 leading-relaxed font-sans mb-10 clear-both\">\n                            Côté mer, l'appel du large est irrésistible avec la <strong>Tentacule de Poulpe à la plancha</strong> et son condiment niçois, ou les superbes <strong>Gambas poêlées</strong> accompagnées d'un risotto crémeux de la Riviera. Côté terre, le Chef sublime les classiques avec un <strong>Suprême de volaille confit aux olives vertes, citron et cumin</strong>, qui incarne à lui seul toutes les saveurs du Sud.\n                        </p>\n<!-- Dimanche 3 Mai (DJ SET) -->\n<div class=\"bg-village-bg/60 border-l-4 border-village-accent p-6 mb-8 mt-12 shadow-sm rounded-sm\">\n<h4 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-village-dark mb-4\">Dimanche 3 Mai : DJ Set &amp; Art en Fête</h4>\n<p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-village-dark/80 leading-relaxed font-sans\">\n                                Pour clore ce week-end de la plus belle des manières, la Place du Château passera en mode <em>Art en Fête</em>. Et pour accompagner cette journée culturelle, Le Village monte le son ! <strong>Dès 12h00, un DJ s'installera sur notre terrasse</strong> pour orchestrer un déjeuner en musique. Le point de ralliement parfait, un verre de rosé bien frais à la main, avant ou après vos visites.\n                            </p>\n</div>\n<!-- Bouton Dossier de Presse & Contact -->\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 border-t border-village-accent/20 pt-8\">\n<a class=\"inline-block bg-village-dark text-village-light hover:bg-village-accent transition-colors duration-300 py-4 px-8 font-sans tracking-widest uppercase text-xs md:text-sm text-center shadow-md\" href=\"https://legrimaldibylevillage.com/dossier-presse\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Dossier de Presse\n                            </a>\n<a class=\"inline-block border border-village-dark text-village-dark hover:bg-village-dark hover:text-village-light transition-colors duration-300 py-4 px-8 font-sans tracking-widest uppercase text-xs md:text-sm text-center\" href=\"https://legrimaldibylevillage.com/la-carte\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Découvrir la carte\n                            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Colonne Visuelle (Image de la carte ouvre un nouvel onglet) -->\n<div class=\"w-full lg:w-2/5 flex justify-center lg:sticky lg:top-32 mt-12 lg:mt-0\">\n<!-- L'IMAGE OUVRE LA CARTE DANS UN NOUVEL ONGLET -->\n<a class=\"menu-presentation-frame group\" href=\"https://legrimaldibylevillage.com/la-carte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Voir la carte complète\">\n<div class=\"menu-image-inner\">\n<img alt=\"La nouvelle carte de printemps du restaurant Le Village\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-contain bg-village-bg\" src=\"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0001-UOvdH59PfVkrM42N.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center mt-4 pb-2 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-village-dark/60 group-hover:text-village-accent transition-colors duration-300\">\n<span class=\"font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest\">Voir la carte complète ↗</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Mini-Galerie de la Suite de la Carte (Pop-up Lightbox Pleine Largeur) -->\n<div class=\"mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-village-accent/20\">\n<h5 class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-village-dark/60 mb-8 text-center\">Feuilleter le menu complet</h5>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n<a class=\"menu-trigger block overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-village-dark/10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 relative group\" data-index=\"0\" href=\"#\" title=\"Agrandir la page\">\n<img alt=\"Menu Page 1\" class=\"w-full h-40 md:h-64 object-cover object-top opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-village-light\" src=\"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0001-UOvdH59PfVkrM42N.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-village-dark/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors\"></div>\n<svg class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 text-village-white drop-shadow-md opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n<a class=\"menu-trigger block overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-village-dark/10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 relative group\" data-index=\"1\" href=\"#\" title=\"Agrandir la page\">\n<img alt=\"Menu Page 2\" class=\"w-full h-40 md:h-64 object-cover object-top opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-village-light\" src=\"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0002-dCjfLzbZOChvxSn0.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-village-dark/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors\"></div>\n<svg class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 text-village-white drop-shadow-md opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n<a class=\"menu-trigger block overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-village-dark/10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 relative group\" data-index=\"2\" href=\"#\" title=\"Agrandir la page\">\n<img alt=\"Menu Page 3\" class=\"w-full h-40 md:h-64 object-cover object-top opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-village-light\" src=\"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0003-Wdtr3QeJV3bq5k32.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-village-dark/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors\"></div>\n<svg class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 text-village-white drop-shadow-md opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n<a class=\"menu-trigger block overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-village-dark/10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 relative group\" data-index=\"3\" href=\"#\" title=\"Agrandir la page\">\n<img alt=\"Menu Page 4\" class=\"w-full h-40 md:h-64 object-cover object-top opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-village-light\" src=\"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0004-rKs8tZaLCkhUd3cd.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-village-dark/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors\"></div>\n<svg class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 text-village-white drop-shadow-md opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- LIGHTBOX GALERIE MENU POP-UP -->\n<div aria-label=\"Carte de printemps\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-village-dark/95 hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 backdrop-blur-sm\" id=\"menuLightbox\" role=\"dialog\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 md:p-6 flex justify-between items-center z-50\">\n<span class=\"font-sans text-village-light uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs font-medium\">Carte de Printemps</span>\n<button aria-label=\"Fermer\" class=\"text-village-light/70 hover:text-village-accent focus:outline-none transition-colors p-2\" id=\"closeLightbox\" title=\"Fermer\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Image précédente\" class=\"absolute left-2 md:left-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-village-light/70 hover:text-village-accent focus:outline-none z-50 transition-transform hover:-translate-x-1 p-2\" id=\"prevLightbox\" title=\"Précédent\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n<div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl h-[85vh] flex items-center justify-center px-12 md:px-24\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-0 text-village-light/50\" id=\"lbLoader\">\n<svg class=\"animate-spin h-8 w-8\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle class=\"opacity-25\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\"></circle><path class=\"opacity-75\" d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"Menu Le Village\" class=\"relative z-10 max-w-full max-h-full object-contain transition-all duration-300 scale-95 opacity-0 shadow-2xl\" id=\"lightboxImage\" src=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Image suivante\" class=\"absolute right-2 md:right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-village-light/70 hover:text-village-accent focus:outline-none z-50 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1 p-2\" id=\"nextLightbox\" title=\"Suivant\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-0 right-0 text-center z-50\">\n<span class=\"font-sans text-village-light/70 text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\" id=\"lightboxCounter\">1 / 4</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- SCRIPT DU POP-UP GALERIE -->\n<script>\n        const menuImages = [\n            \"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0001-UOvdH59PfVkrM42N.jpg\",\n            \"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0002-dCjfLzbZOChvxSn0.jpg\",\n            \"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0003-Wdtr3QeJV3bq5k32.jpg\",\n            \"https://assets.zyrosite.com/gnKoPAn3rxzY53IR/carte-avril-26_page-0004-rKs8tZaLCkhUd3cd.jpg\"\n        ];\n        \n        let currentMenuIndex = 0;\n        let previousFocus = null;\n        const lightbox = document.getElementById('menuLightbox');\n        const lbImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImage');\n        const counter = document.getElementById('lightboxCounter');\n        const loader = document.getElementById('lbLoader');\n\n        function updateImage() {\n            lbImg.style.opacity = 0;\n            lbImg.classList.remove('scale-100');\n            lbImg.classList.add('scale-95');\n            loader.classList.remove('hidden');\n            \n            setTimeout(() => {\n\n                counter.innerText = (currentMenuIndex + 1) + \" / \" + menuImages.length;\n                \n                lbImg.onload = () => {\n                    loader.classList.add('hidden');\n                    lbImg.style.opacity = 1;\n                    lbImg.classList.remove('scale-95');\n                    lbImg.classList.add('scale-100');\n                };\n                lbImg.onerror = () => { loader.classList.add('hidden'); lbImg.style.opacity = 1; };\n                lbImg.src = menuImages[currentMenuIndex];\n                if (lbImg.complete && lbImg.naturalWidth) lbImg.onload();\n            }, 200);\n        }\n\n        function openLightbox(index) {\n            previousFocus = window.document.activeElement;\n            currentMenuIndex = index;\n            lightbox.classList.remove('hidden');\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                lightbox.classList.remove('opacity-0');\n            }, 10);\n            updateImage();\n            document.getElementById('closeLightbox').focus();\n            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n        }\n\n        function closeLightbox() {\n            lightbox.classList.add('opacity-0');\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                lightbox.classList.add('hidden');\n                document.body.style.overflow = '';\n                previousFocus?.focus();\n            }, 300);\n        }\n\n        function changeLightboxImage(direction) {\n            currentMenuIndex = (currentMenuIndex + direction + menuImages.length) % menuImages.length;\n            updateImage();\n        }\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.menu-trigger').forEach((el) => {\n            el.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                let idx = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-index'));\n                openLightbox(idx);\n            });\n        });\n\n        document.getElementById('closeLightbox').addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);\n        document.getElementById('prevLightbox').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); changeLightboxImage(-1); });\n        document.getElementById('nextLightbox').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); changeLightboxImage(1); });\n        \n        lightbox.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n            if(e.target === lightbox || e.target.parentElement === lightbox) closeLightbox();\n        });\n\n        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n            if(!lightbox.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n                if(e.key === 'Tab') {\n                    const buttons = [...lightbox.querySelectorAll('button')];\n                    const first = buttons[0], last = buttons[buttons.length - 1];\n                    if(e.shiftKey && window.document.activeElement === first) { e.preventDefault(); last.focus(); }\n                    else if(!e.shiftKey && window.document.activeElement === last) { e.preventDefault(); first.focus(); }\n                }\n                if(e.key === 'Escape') closeLightbox();\n                if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft') changeLightboxImage(-1);\n                if(e.key === 'ArrowRight') changeLightboxImage(1);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</div>\n<!-- ===================================================================== -->\n<!-- FIN DE LA SECTION \"COMMUNIQUÉ 1ER MAI & CARTE\" -->\n<!-- ===================================================================== -->"
    }
